{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"636012145204527127","content":"Leaf's Platapusocalypse\n*2nd-level Conjuration*\n\n**Casting time:** 1 Action\n**Range:** 500 feet\n**Components:** V, S, M (A tuft of fur, an eggshell, and flower.)\n**Duration:** 1 hour\n\nYou summon 2d8 platapus (CR 0)  that appear in unoccupied spaces that you can see within range. A summoned creature disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends. \nThe summoned platapus are friendly to you and your companions. Roll initiative for the summoned creatures as a group, which have their own turns. They obey any verbal commands that you issue to them (no action required by you). If you don't issue any commands to then, they defend themselves from hostile creatures, but otherwise take no actions.\n\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell at 4th level or higher, the number of platapus summoned by 2d8 for every two slot levels above 2nd.","created_at":"2020-07-25T11:06:11.479000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736539795433586809","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
